{"id":50604,"date":"2026-04-11T08:36:50","date_gmt":"2026-04-11T07:36:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50604"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:04:17","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:04:17","slug":"walking-festival-trail-jurassico","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/walking-festival-trail-jurassico\/","title":{"rendered":"Walking Festival &amp; Trail Jur\u00e1ssico 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A<strong>&nbsp;Junta de Freguesia de Santiago de Lit\u00e9m<\/strong>&nbsp;ir\u00e1 organizar o&nbsp;<strong>SANTIAGO DE LIT\u00c9M WALKING FESTIVAL &amp; TRAIL JUR\u00c1SSICO<\/strong>, com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o das colectividades da Freguesia, nos dias<strong>&nbsp;8, 9 e 10 de Maio de 2026<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&nbsp;Este evento nasce num contexto particularmente desafiante para o nosso territ\u00f3rio, na sequ\u00eancia dos fen\u00f3menos meteorol\u00f3gicos adversos recentemente verificados, que provocaram danos significativos no tecido associativo local, em habita\u00e7\u00f5es, infraestruturas e espa\u00e7os naturais. Neste enquadramento, o evento assume-se n\u00e3o apenas como uma iniciativa desportiva, mas como um momento de mobiliza\u00e7\u00e3o comunit\u00e1ria com os seguintes objetivos:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\" >\n<li>Promover a recupera\u00e7\u00e3o e valoriza\u00e7\u00e3o dos trilhos e espa\u00e7os naturais da freguesia;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Real\u00e7ar o esp\u00edrito de resili\u00eancia da popula\u00e7\u00e3o e dinamizar o tecido associativo (Garecus, Dino Clube, Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Bem Estar e Arunca);<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Valorizar o patrim\u00f3nio natural, cultural e paleontol\u00f3gico e sensibilizar para a preserva\u00e7\u00e3o ambiental face a fen\u00f3menos clim\u00e1ticos extremos.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":50605,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22],"event_type_2":[38,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50604","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-santiago-litem-pombal","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type_2-leiria","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/pop_4h9707u940.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50604","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=50604"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50604\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":61725,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50604\/revisions\/61725"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/50605"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=50604"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=50604"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=50604"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json